#: app/templates/index.html
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Bem-vindos"

#: app/templates/index.html
msgid "We're getting married and we'd love for you to join us!"
msgstr "Vamos casar e adorávamos que estivesses connosco!"

#. Countdown labels (lowercase variant currently used in index.html)
